{"parse":{"title":"角色印象PV：嘉西娅","pageid":3108,"revid":6652,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1PV%EF%BC%9A%E5%98%89%E8%A5%BF%E5%A8%85&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1PV%EF%BC%9A%E5%98%89%E8%A5%BF%E5%A8%85&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1PV%EF%BC%9A%E5%98%89%E8%A5%BF%E5%A8%85&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98\" title=\"专题\">专题</a> &gt; <b>角色印象PV：嘉西娅</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E5.8D.B0.E8.B1.A1PV.7C.E5.98.89.E8.A5.BF.E5.A8.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色印象PV|嘉西娅\">角色印象PV|嘉西娅</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1PV%EF%BC%9A%E5%98%89%E8%A5%BF%E5%A8%85&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：角色印象PV|嘉西娅\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-01 15:12<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F-Q2vx1sOBgiOWn-n7j-4AA\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-Q2vx1sOBgiOWn-n7j-4AA</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>团长们九月好~<br />\n伴随着<font color=\"brown\"><b>愉快周末</b></font>的开始<br />\n一起来看看<font color=\"brown\"><b>嘉西娅</b></font>的角色印象pv吧\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<br />\n即便有着<font color=\"brown\"><b>出色的实力</b></font><br />\n嘉西娅也从未停止<font color=\"brown\"><b>追随</b></font>萨曼莎的脚步<br />\n前辈<font color=\"brown\"><b>强大坚定</b></font>的精神被嘉西娅视为<font color=\"brown\"><b>灯塔</b></font><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>救赎</b></font>她内心深处的<font color=\"brown\"><b>孤独</b></font>与<font color=\"brown\"><b>迷茫</b></font>\n<br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>萨曼莎姐姐一定会对我刮目相看的！</b></font>\n</p>\n<br /><br /></center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">中文CV：王晓彤</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1zG411d7Xg\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"【铃兰之剑】角色印象PV：嘉西娅\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"300\"></div>\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">日文CV：大空直美</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;